2026-11-09",12,"今日安静，无重要安全事件","2026-11-10",13,"GPUStack v2.2.0 之前认证绕过漏洞已被在野利用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","2026-11-27",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","2026-11-28",31,"DIVD 内网入侵复盘：Zammad 漏洞与 ARP 欺骗注入 PostgreSQL 数据包",32,"Ubuntu 更新 Apache HTTP Server 漏洞并修复重定向 Cookie 回归问题","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-27","generatedAt","2026-11-27T00:00:18.900Z","lead",{"_57":136,"_342":334},"leadItemId","edycapt0khpdxw9pdgw91bldq","overview","highlights",[337,338,339],"sections",[241,242,243],"flashes",[177,178,179,180,181,182],"cover",{"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":-5,"_175":-5,"_176":-5},"metrics",{"_165":81,"_166":69,"_167":168,"_169":168},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/2e9228d7fb36395c.webp","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/1732e93eda12cf3a.webp 720w, /dailyinfo/media/f08944e58a3d14c6.webp 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/2e9228d7fb36395c.webp 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_183":234,"_57":235,"_186":236,"_188":237,"_190":238,"_192":239,"_194":-5,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_240":125},{"_183":226,"_57":227,"_186":228,"_188":229,"_190":230,"_192":231,"_194":232,"_196":233,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":218,"_57":219,"_186":220,"_188":221,"_190":222,"_192":223,"_194":224,"_196":225,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":210,"_57":211,"_186":212,"_188":213,"_190":214,"_192":215,"_194":216,"_196":217,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":202,"_57":203,"_186":204,"_188":205,"_190":206,"_192":207,"_194":208,"_196":209,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":184,"_57":185,"_186":187,"_188":189,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_198":199,"_200":201},"itemId","wcbx8pzdh8mopdy9bq9yswr42","Microsoft 与 CSA 披露 ARTEX AI 攻击框架已被多组攻击者采用","summary","Microsoft 与 CSA 报告称，中国及朝鲜关联攻击组织已将开源 AI 自主渗透测试框架 ARTEX 用于网络侦察、凭据攻击和 Web 应用利用，部分攻击链可在 3 小时内取得特权访问，Infrawatch 则发现野外存在 130 多个变种。","sourceName","Infosecurity Magazine","sourceUrl","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/chinese-north-korea-artex/","publishedAt","2026-11-26T11:05:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"abw88sikyjf3ei7ewn5j1y97k","Socket 发现 13 个恶意 NuGet 包借假 .NET 招聘测评投递恶意软件","Socket 研究员 Kush Pandya 披露，13 个恶意 NuGet 包伪装成 WinUI 3 与 WPF 按钮控件组件，以假 .NET 岗位测评项目引诱 Windows 开发者上钩，最早上传为 2026 年 7 月 23 日、最后两个为 11 月 4 日，涉及包均已被 NuGet 下架。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/13-malicious-nuget-packages-turn-fake.html","2026-11-26T03:48:52.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","xxw8h23ag2c76hyuqa5gblkin","同一 vLLM 推理服务器中的模型可经侧信道通信并绕过不可信监控","研究证明，运行在同一 vLLM 推理服务器上的模型即使无法直接交互，也能利用 GPU 内核选择造成的激活值舍入差异建立 Step Sizing 与 KV Cache Message Board 两种通信信道。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/96012","2026-11-25T15:42:31.770Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","pnwissspx929ot29q3os3ghqs","Google 要求 Workspace AI agent 自 2027 年 2 月起经 MCP 或 CLI 接入","Google 宣布 Workspace AI Tools Addendum，AI agent 必须经 Google Workspace MCP servers 或 CLI 连接产品服务，技术强制执行时间为 2027 年 2 月 1 日，常规应用仍可沿用现有 REST API。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/26/google-ai-agent-security-requirements/","2026-11-26T05:30:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","a5fzo7vwm6srlhz65h7wxvfw8","Juniper Session Smart Conductor 严重漏洞 CVE-2026-103406 已被利用","Juniper Networks 与 CISA 确认，CVE-2026-103406 已在攻击中被利用，CVSS 9.8。该远程 OS 命令注入漏洞影响 Session Smart Conductor 的 AutomatedProvisionor 服务，攻击者可通过特制 Salt minion ID 以 root 权限执行任意命令。","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/critical-juniper-session-smart-conductor-flaw-exploited-in-attacks/","2026-11-26T13:04:06.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","jblr1k53v48qh6dq6bshhgrco","Azure APIM Classic管理面事件复盘与凭据处置闭环","Azure APIM Classic特定配置下的未授权管理访问已被用于搜寻令牌、秘密和Named Values，Equinor与Skagerak Energi均属受影响机构；微软已于11月19日关闭未授权路径，但此前暴露的凭据不会自动失效。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521536&idx=1&sn=3f7e713fb6f97c70ae06aa6c23c6795f","2026-11-26T05:09:00.000Z","followUp",{"_244":305,"_186":-5,"_246":306},{"_244":263,"_186":-5,"_246":264},{"_244":245,"_186":-5,"_246":247},"label","研究与披露","items",[248,249],{"_183":258,"_57":259,"_186":260,"_188":253,"_190":261,"_192":262,"_194":256,"_196":257,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":250,"_57":251,"_186":252,"_188":253,"_190":254,"_192":255,"_194":256,"_196":257,"_198":199,"_200":201},"ougur29x6priknjuve15twubc","ELF DT_RELR 压缩重定位导致 objdump -R 审计盲区分析与绕过","研究复现了 GNU 与 LLVM 的 objdump -R 不展开 DT_RELR 的审计盲区：样本 librelr.so 含 11 个动态重定位目标，objdump -R 仅报告 7 个。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93459","2026-11-25T02:59:10.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","dxxqjaqglxg4apdale1xcta81","PHP-FPM FastCGI 连接复用请求走私漏洞 CVE-2026-129289 分析与复现","PHP-FPM FastCGI 连接复用漏洞 CVE-2026-129289 可在 multipart 解析异常后残留伪造请求，以未授权身份执行第二个 FastCGI 请求并触发 www-data RCE，CVSS 4.0 为 9.2。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93458","2026-11-24T16:05:14.000Z","攻击与威胁",[265,266,267,268,269,270],{"_183":300,"_57":301,"_186":302,"_188":229,"_190":303,"_192":304,"_194":232,"_196":233,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":295,"_57":296,"_186":297,"_188":213,"_190":298,"_192":299,"_194":216,"_196":217,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":287,"_57":288,"_186":289,"_188":290,"_190":291,"_192":292,"_194":293,"_196":294,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":281,"_57":282,"_186":283,"_188":189,"_190":284,"_192":285,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_286":50},{"_183":276,"_57":277,"_186":278,"_188":221,"_190":279,"_192":280,"_194":224,"_196":225,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":271,"_57":272,"_186":273,"_188":205,"_190":274,"_192":275,"_194":208,"_196":209,"_198":199,"_200":201},"m5ausxhtut34kmi7zcnx0ncei","North Korea关联PolinRider污染超7,600个GitHub仓库传播恶意软件","North Korea关联的PolinRider活动通过劫持开发者账户、提交恶意Pull Request和重写Git历史，向至少7,609个GitHub仓库植入Python加载器，涉及2,330个账户；2026年10月27日至11月6日间已推送至2,040个仓库。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/north-korea-linked-polinrider-poisons.html","2026-11-26T15:13:41.000Z","en1gv0ci3e610k5ce0nrbau25","Kaspersky 发现 Keenadu 后门预装于超过 220,000 台 Android 设备","Kaspersky 在前 10 个月内于超过 220,000 台 Android 设备中发现 Keenadu；它与 Triada 合计出现在今年检出预装恶意软件设备的 88% 中。","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/26/keenadu-malware-android-devices/","2026-11-26T12:57:58.000Z","nn1df6kue93w1afswhivjvdl3","攻击者利用 Hugging Face AI 网站生成器搭建 42 个钓鱼页面","Aikido Security 发现攻击者在 Hugging Face Spaces 托管 42 个钓鱼与凭据窃取页面，其中 29 个由平台内置的 AI 网站生成器 DeepSite 构建，仿冒 28 个品牌，包括 Microsoft、PayPal 和 Netflix。","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/hugging-face-ai-builder-phishing/","2026-11-26T12:30:00.000Z","otherSources","g2obwrf736za9vvdn0fst3ayg","SYS010 信息窃取木马借 Meta 广告强制安装浏览器扩展窃取 Gmail 与 Outlook 邮件","Bitdefender Labs 披露 SYS010 信息窃取木马通过 Meta 广告伪装成免费动态壁纸应用下载，诱导 Windows 用户安装后强制为 Chrome、Edge 和 Firefox 配置恶意扩展，目标是 Facebook 与 Meta 商业账户及 Gmail、Outlook 邮件。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/sys010-malware-abuses-browser-management-to-spy-on-gmail-outlook/","2026-11-26T11:50:17.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","tw1sqonucogwlek1xpza88mc0","美国 CIA 开源情报系统疑遭 AI 驱动的 ARTEX 渗透测试智能体入侵","身份不明的攻击者使用 AI 驱动的 ARTEX 渗透测试框架入侵美国中央情报局（CIA）开源情报（OSINT）分析系统，并波及 ODNI 和美国国家地理空间情报局。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/96026","2026-11-26T09:55:28.909Z","kcwxcgi3mbarz9m115ch1kn3v","Mitel MiCollab 5 个零日漏洞遭在野利用，CISA 已将其纳入 KEV","Mitel MiCollab 5 个漏洞已被用于数据窃取和可能的勒索活动，CISA 将其纳入 KEV，其中 4 个要求联邦机构在 11 月 28 日前处置，另 1 个截止日期为 12 月 9 日。","https://www.securityweek.com/mitel-micollab-zero-days-exploited-in-suspected-ai-assisted-attacks/","2026-11-26T11:35:25.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[307,308,309,310],{"_183":150,"_57":136,"_186":334,"_188":229,"_190":335,"_192":336,"_194":232,"_196":233,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_286":54},{"_183":321,"_57":322,"_186":323,"_188":213,"_190":324,"_192":325,"_194":216,"_196":217,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_286":54,"_326":327,"_240":131},{"_183":316,"_57":317,"_186":318,"_188":205,"_190":319,"_192":320,"_194":208,"_196":209,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":311,"_57":312,"_186":313,"_188":189,"_190":314,"_192":315,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_198":199,"_200":201},"waly7f5cwuea4sg732ir9h5vt","Danfoss AK-SM 8xxA Series 控制器曝栈溢出漏洞 CVE-2026-129713，CVSS 9.8","Danfoss AK-SM 8xxA Series 控制器的未认证 CGI 处理器存在栈溢出漏洞 CVE-2026-129713，CVSS 为 9.8，远程攻击者发送特制 HTTP/S POST 请求可导致内存损坏、webserver 重启，并可能以 webserver 权限执行任意代码。","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/cisa-alert-danfoss-critical-flaw/","2026-11-26T14:15:00.000Z","nkult1dbuzi5bl0l22u9aiv2c","攻击者利用 Mitel、Juniper、Vates 与 Danfoss 的 10 个漏洞，CISA 已列入 KEV","CISA 将 Mitel MiCollab、Vates Xen Orchestra、Juniper Session Smart Conductor 与 Router、Danfoss AK-SM 800A Series 制冷控制器的 10 个漏洞加入 KEV，其中部分已有在野利用报告。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-10-vulnerabilities.html","2026-11-26T06:44:46.000Z","zptj6mohcgm2b6eayxup65amy","Drupal 安装程序远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-132165 已被在野利用","奇安信 CERT 监测到 Drupal 安装程序远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-132165 已被在野利用，该漏洞源于 Drupal core 安装器状态校验不当，攻击者可匿名续跑 /core/install.php 流程，覆盖 uid 1 管理员账户的用户名、邮箱和密码，接管站点并借已有模块、主题或文件写入入口执行任意命令。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95992","2026-11-24T16:00:00.000Z","related",[328],{"_183":329,"_57":330,"_186":-5,"_188":331,"_190":332,"_192":333,"_194":-5,"_198":201,"_200":201},"ezziepbuq0itfxhnntdri5mbl","Drupal 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-132165 已发现在野利用","绿盟科技CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MjE3ODkxNg==&mid=2247494332&idx=1&sn=20e10be7965d6e9f32dedeab3022393a","2026-11-26T10:33:00.000Z","Drupal 披露 CVE-2026-136716，其 CMSS 评分为 21/25，属于可导致网站接管的访问绕过漏洞，并确认已在野利用。","https://www.securityweek.com/drupal-installer-patch-left-a-gap-attackers-are-already-exploiting/","2026-11-26T09:12:26.000Z",{"_183":258,"_57":259,"_186":260,"_188":253,"_190":261,"_192":262,"_194":256,"_196":257,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":300,"_57":301,"_186":302,"_188":229,"_190":303,"_192":304,"_194":232,"_196":233,"_198":199,"_200":201},{"_183":321,"_57":322,"_186":323,"_188":213,"_190":324,"_192":325,"_194":216,"_196":217,"_198":199,"_200":201,"_286":54,"_326":340,"_240":131},[341],{"_183":329,"_57":330,"_186":-5,"_188":331,"_190":332,"_192":333,"_194":-5,"_198":201,"_200":201},"leadParagraph",{"_344":345,"_346":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
